</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T2.2.1.26" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T2.2.1.26.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Spatial soundstage</td>
<td id="S5.T2.2.1.26.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
