</section>
<section id="A1.SS1.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.1.2 </span>Image Reference and Motion Reference Generation</h4>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The model supports using image references to determine content and style, while simultaneously using motion references (e.g., pose sequences, trajectories) to control the dynamic characteristics of the generated video.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.SSS2.2" class="ltx_logical-block">
          
<div id="A1.SS1.SSS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.SS1.SSS2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Instruction:</span> <span id="A1.SS1.SSS2.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Animate the person in @image_1 using the movements from @video_1.</span></p>
<table id="A1.SS1.SSS2.p2.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A1.SS1.SSS2.p2.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
