<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Video Inpainting</h3>

<section id="A1.SS2.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.2.1 </span>Subject/Attribute/Background Inpainting</h4>

<div id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The model can precisely inpaint specific regions in videos, including subject replacement, attribute modification, and background replacement.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.SSS1.2" class="ltx_logical-block">
          
<div id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
