<section id="A1.SS2.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.2.2 </span>Image Reference Inpainting</h4>

<div id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The model supports using reference images to guide the inpainting process, ensuring that the inpainted content is consistent with the reference style.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.SSS2.2" class="ltx_logical-block">
          
<div id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Instruction:</span> <span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Add the man from @image_1 to the left mask area of @video_1.</span></p>
