<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Video Editing</h3>

<section id="A1.SS3.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.3.1 </span>Local Editing</h4>

<div id="A1.SS3.SSS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The model enables fine-grained local video editing: subject, attribute, and element edits.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Watermark/Subtitle/Logo Removal</h5>

<div id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The model can intelligently identify and remove watermarks, subtitles, logos, and other elements from videos while maintaining content coherence and naturalness.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px1.p2.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Instruction:</span> <span id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px1.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Remove watermarks in @video_1.</span>

<span id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px1.p2.1.3" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<span class="ltx_tbody">
<span id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px1.p2.1.3.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px1.p2.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle" style="padding-bottom: 2.0pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px1.p2.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_align_middle ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:12.0pt;height:61.1pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="width:61.1pt;transform:translate(-26.1pt,-26.1pt) rotate(-90deg) ;">
<span id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px1.p2.1.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px1.p2.1.3.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input Video</span></span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px1.p2.1.3.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle" style="padding-bottom: 2.0pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px1.p2.1.3.1.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:75.9pt;"><img src="2602.21818v1/figures/appendix/A.2.2_ex.1_Input_Video_1.jpg" id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/268;" width="476" height="268" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
</span></span>
