</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px1.p2.1.3.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px1.p2.1.3.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:75.9pt;"><img src="2602.21818v1/figures/appendix/A.2.2_ex.1_Output_Video_1.jpg" id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px1.g4" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/268;" width="476" height="268" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
