<section id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Subject Manipulation</h5>

<div id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The model supports adding, deleting, and modifying subjects in videos while maintaining temporal consistency.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px2.1" class="ltx_logical-block">
            
<div id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px2.p2" class="ltx_para">
