<section id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Local Attribute Editing</h5>

<div id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The model can perform fine-grained editing of attributes for specific objects or regions in videos, such as color, texture, shape, etc.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px3.1" class="ltx_logical-block">
            
