<section id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Background Editing</h5>

<div id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The model supports modifying background elements while preserving the foreground subjects.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px4.1" class="ltx_logical-block">
            
