<section id="A1.SS3.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.3.2 </span>Global Editing</h4>

<div id="A1.SS3.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The model supports global modifications that affect the entire video, including style, camera properties, and scene attributes.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS3.SSS2.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Style Transfer</h5>

<div id="A1.SS3.SSS2.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS2.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The model can transform videos into different artistic or visual styles while maintaining semantic consistency of the video content.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.SSS2.Px1.1" class="ltx_logical-block">
            
<div id="A1.SS3.SSS2.Px1.p2" class="ltx_para">
